#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:1
msgid "Layout Visualization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:3
msgid "TileLang provides two related ways to inspect data layouts:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:5
msgid ""
"`tilelang.tools.plot_layout` plots a `T.Layout` or `T.Fragment` that you "
"already have."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:7
msgid ""
"Layout inference visualization prints fragment layouts discovered by the "
"compiler and can save a plot for each inferred two-dimensional fragment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:10
msgid ""
"Use the first workflow while designing a mapping and the second when "
"checking the mapping selected for buffers in a compiled kernel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:13
msgid "Installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:15
msgid ""
"PNG, PDF, and SVG output requires Matplotlib. Install TileLang's "
"visualization extra:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:18
msgid "pip install \"tilelang[vis]\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:22
msgid "Text-only compiler output does not create a Matplotlib figure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:24
msgid "Plot a Layout Directly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:26
msgid "This example plots a 4 by 4 transpose mapping:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:28
msgid ""
"import tilelang.language as T\n"
"from tilelang.tools import plot_layout\n"
"\n"
"transpose = T.Layout([4, 4], lambda i, j: (j, i))\n"
"\n"
"plot_layout(\n"
"    transpose,\n"
"    save_directory=\"./tmp\",\n"
"    name=\"transpose_4x4\",\n"
"    formats=\"png\",\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:42
msgid ""
"The call writes `./tmp/transpose_4x4.png` and prints the saved path. In the "
"default input view, each grid cell represents an input position and its "
"label is the flattened output position. Set `view=\"output\"` to put output "
"positions on the grid and label them with their source coordinates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:47
msgid ""
"For a `T.Fragment`, cells are colored by thread and labeled with both the "
"thread ID (`T`) and thread-local register index (`L`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:50
msgid "plot_layout(fragment, name=\"mma_load\", formats=\"pdf\")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:54
msgid "`plot_layout` API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/layout_visualization.md:56
msgid ""
"plot_layout(\n"
"    layout,\n"
"    save_directory=\"./tmp\",\n"
"    name=\"layout\",\n"
"    colormap=None,\n"
"    verbose=False,\n"
"    formats=\"pdf\",\n"
"    view=\"input\",\n"
"    grid_shape=None,\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""

